        "layers":["[{\"Mars_Viking_MDIM21_ClrMosaic_global_232m\",1}]"],
        "description":"<p>Take a guided tour of key locations visited by Perseverance.  Each Point of Interest along the Perseverance path includes a video featuring a stunning 360 degree panorama from the mast-mounted camera system on Perseverance known as Mastcam-Z.  The videos are narrated by different members of the Mastcam-Z team, starting with the introductory video at the first Point of Interest narrated by Jim Bell, the team's lead scientist.  These immersive videos will transport you to the surface of Jezero crater and provide engaging descriptions of the landscapes and discoveries made by Perseverance. Additional information about Mastcam-Z is available at <a href='https://mastcamz.asu.edu/' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>https://mastcamz.asu.edu/</a></p>",
